  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be a function defined <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>99</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "99",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>99</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>...</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>99</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>99</mn></math></p>"
